00:37:19.074 --> 00:37:19.755
Siap? Oke.

00:37:19.795 --> 00:37:20.594
Berdiri tegak.

00:37:21.154 --> 00:37:21.634
Di sana.

00:37:21.755 --> 00:37:22.355
Bergerak.

00:37:23.235 --> 00:37:23.554
Datang.

00:37:23.634 --> 00:37:24.275
Datanglah padaku.

00:37:27.434 --> 00:37:28.434
Terakhir kali 133cm.

00:37:28.474 --> 00:37:29.395
Sekarang 134cm.

00:37:29.434 --> 00:37:31.074
Seberapa besar pertumbuhanmu?

00:37:32.395 --> 00:37:33.074
Satu sentimeter.

00:37:33.514 --> 00:37:36.235
Mari kita rayakan pertumbuhan Lin!

00:37:36.434 --> 00:37:38.235
Aku akan memasak hidangan lezat untukmu, oke?

00:37:45.915 --> 00:37:46.554
Saya juga ingat.

00:37:53.795 --> 00:37:54.474
Punya lipstik?

00:38:06.275 --> 00:38:06.835
Berdiri diam.

